Stack Overflow : A stack overflow error happens when a program uses more memory on the call stack than is available.
                 Ab isme function call hote ja raha hai baar baar baar , koi rukne ki jagah hi nhi hai

Base Condition : You need to stop it somewhere, and the condition you used to stop it is called base condition.

Recursion tree : A recursion tree is a diagram that helps you visualize how a recursive function calls itself — showing each function call as a node in a tree. 🌳

